  Made with a synthetic upper with a smooth finish, the sandal is designed for easy maintenance and regular wear. Underfoot, the cushion sole helps provide soft comfort, while the lightweight PU sole offers support, durability, and a stable base for everyday walking comfort.', 279.0, 289.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_1111b6ae-6de2-4458-8121-faf609897260.jpg?v=1786511281&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_1111b6ae-6de2-4458-8121-faf609897260.jpg?v=1786511281&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
