Contoured comfort: EVA footbed with heel cup & gentle arch rise

Soft touch: synthetic leather footbed cover helps reduce slip & hotspots

Easy fit: Two adjustable Velcro straps + slip-on closure

All-day ready: Lightweight feel, stable stance, minimal break-in

