The sandal comes in an elegant Brown color with attractive printed floral-inspired straps that add a stylish touch to everyday outfits. The dual-strap design provides comfortable foot coverage, while the strap construction helps offer a secure and comfortable fit. The decorative Walkaroo branding on the straps adds a distinctive finishing detail.

