The Ergosteps feature is designed with everyday walking comfort in mind, helping provide a comfort', 529.0, 529.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WGP58090-BLACK-GENTS_b5b4c509-016f-4659-b460-d6d86ffac5b8.jpg?v=1787997065&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WGP58090-BLACK-GENTS_b5b4c509-016f-4659-b460-d6d86ffac5b8.jpg?v=1787997065&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
