The flip-flop features a broad Khaki Olive upper with contrast stitching and a stylish layered strap design. A secondary tan strap with FLIP-FLOPZ branding adds a distinctive casual finish, while the broad slip-on construction helps provide comfortable foot coverage and a secure everyday fit.
