INSERT INTO public.products (slug, title, brand, category, description, min_price, max_price, currency, in_stock, image_url, images, variant_count) VALUES ('urbanoz-mens-comfort-sandals-wge53241-olive', 'Men''s Comfort Sandals - WGE53241 Olive', 'URBANOZ', 'Sandals', 'Quick Highlights


Contoured comfort: EVA footbed with heel cup & gentle arch rise

Soft touch: Microfiber suede footbed cover helps reduce slip & hotspots

Adjustable fit: Dual metal buckles for easy tightening/loosening

All-day ready: Lightweight feel, stable stance, minimal break-in

City-proof traction: Treaded PU outsole for everyday slip-resistance
Made in India

Designed for urban days that don’t slow down, URBANOZ WGE53241 wraps feet in a soft synthetic leather footbed with supportive contouring. Dual buckles let you dial in the fit across the forefoot and instep, while the PU outsole grips typical indoor floors and city pavements. The olive nubuck-look upper pairs easily with denim, chinos, or shorts for a clean, minimalist vibe.
Specs & Materials


Upper: PU synthetic nubuck (olive)

Lining: Fabric

Footbed Cover: synthetic leather 

Footbed/Insole: Contoured EVA with heel cup & arch support

Outsole: PU with slip-resistant tread pattern

Country of Origin: India

