The sandal features an elegant French Beige color with a stylish cross-strap upper design. A polished metallic buckle-style accent enhances its overall appearance, while the overlapping straps help provide a secure and comfortable fit. Its versatile neutral shade pairs easily with casual, ethnic, and semi-casual outfits.
Underfoot, the sandal features a Cushioned Footbed designed to provide a soft and comfortable feel during regular walking. The Arch Support Sole helps support the natural shape of the foot, while the U-Shaped Heel Cup assists with heel positioning and stability during everyday movement.
