Crafted entirely from durable and flexible EVA material, these slippers provide exceptional cushioning and a remarkably soft feel underfoot. The modern Navy Blue color offers a versatile and masculine aesthetic, making them a great choice for various casual settings. Engineered for all-day comfort, their seamless construction ensures a lightweight and relaxed experience with every step.
