With its monochromatic design and minimalist silhouette, this sandal offers a sleek and modern look that pairs effortlessly with a wide range of casual and daily outfits. The lightweight construction and superior cushioning make it an ideal choice for all-day wear, whether you''re running errands or enjoying a day of relaxation.
Key Feat', 299.0, 339.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_89fb2a56-793b-44fb-b3b4-9afab31998d2.jpg?v=1786511668&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_89fb2a56-793b-44fb-b3b4-9afab31998d2.jpg?v=1786511668&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 7) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
