For enhanced underfoot comfort, the sandal comes with a Cushion Sole that provides a soft and comfortable feel during everyday use. The lightweight sole construction supports easy movement, making it suitable for walking, shopping, errands, casual outings, and other daily activities.
The Espresso brown color combination gives this sandal a versati', 579.0, 579.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WLP72090-ESPRESSO-LADIES.jpg?v=1787985393&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WLP72090-ESPRESSO-LADIES.jpg?v=1787985393&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
