Article Number: WL7645
    
Closure: Slip-on
    
Sole Material: PU (durable & long-lasting)
    
Comfort: Soft cushioned footbed for everyday ease
    
Style: Casual daily wear sandals with an elegant finish
  

  Why You’ll Love It
