Why this Walkaroo sandal is better than similar options from other brands:Th', 364.0, 379.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_6b12bf85-02d4-4f9a-a25b-273b32ab204a.jpg?v=1786511553&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/1_6b12bf85-02d4-4f9a-a25b-273b32ab204a.jpg?v=1786511553&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
