The black sole complements the upper to create a clean monochrome appearance. The textured outsole is d', 499.0, 499.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WLR19999-BLACK-LADIES_55edfafe-3791-4b64-ad13-e00daf87de71.jpg?v=1788783037&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WLR19999-BLACK-LADIES_55edfafe-3791-4b64-ad13-e00daf87de71.jpg?v=1788783037&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 4) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
