The classic Brown colour makes these sandals easy to pair with jeans, shorts, chinos, and casual trousers. Desi', 799.0, 799.0, 'INR', True, 'https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WGE53494-BROWN-GENTS.jpg?v=1793074450&width=1920', '["https://www.walkaroo.in/cdn/shop/files/WGE53494-BROWN-GENTS.jpg?v=1793074450&width=1920"]'::jsonb, 5) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, min_price = EXCLUDED.min_price, max_price = EXCLUDED.max_price, in_stock = EXCLUDED.in_stock, image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, images = EXCLUDED.images;
